"\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-progress\"><span id=\"reading-progress\"></span></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"route-curtain\" id=\"route-curtain\"><div class=\"curtain-brand\"><img src=\"/brand/showset-approved.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2389\" height=\"572\" decoding=\"async\"/></div></div>\n<header class=\"site-header\" id=\"site-header\">\n<div class=\"header-inner\">\n<a aria-label=\"SHOWSET home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\"><img class=\"approved-wordmark\" src=\"/brand/approved-wordmark.png\" alt=\"SHOWSET — events &amp; creative agency\" width=\"962\" height=\"250\"/></a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-navigation\">\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/events-experiences/\" data-route-key=\"events\">Events &amp; Experiences</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/creative-design/\" data-route-key=\"creative\">Creative &amp; Design</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/digital-marketing/\" data-route-key=\"digital\">Digital &amp; Marketing</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/content-production/\" data-route-key=\"production\">Content &amp; Production</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"#work\">Our work</a>\n</nav>\n<a class=\"header-cta\" href=\"#contact\">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"round-icon\">↗</span></a>\n<button aria-controls=\"mobile-panel\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"mobile-toggle\" id=\"mobile-toggle\"><span></span><span></span></button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobile-panel\" id=\"mobile-panel\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a href=\"#home\">Home</a><a href=\"#events\">Events &amp; experiences</a><a href=\"#creative\">Creative &amp; design</a><a href=\"#digital\">Digital &amp; marketing</a><a href=\"#production\">Content &amp; production</a><a href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a href=\"#work\">Our work</a></nav>\n<div class=\"mobile-signature\">Big ideas. Every detail. Memorable experiences.</div>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"view is-current\" data-view=\"home\">\n<!-- FIRST ACT: one strong image, no floating picture elements -->\n<section aria-label=\"SHOWSET introduction\" class=\"hero-track\" id=\"hero-track\">\n<div class=\"hero-stage\" id=\"hero-stage\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-ambient\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-photo\" id=\"hero-photo\"><img alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"/concept-12/857bfe33201dcedbc6c9.webp\"/><div class=\"hero-photo-wash\"></div><div class=\"hero-photo-reflection\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-foreground\" id=\"hero-foreground\">\n<h1 class=\"hero-title\"><span class=\"line\"><span>Great ideas</span></span><span class=\"line hero-accent-phrase\"><span>move people<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h1>\n<p>And they should go places. Into rooms. Across screens. Onto stages. Into the hands and heads of real people. We bring events and creative work together to make sure they do.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-links\"><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#services\">See what we do <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-arrow-link\" href=\"#studio\">Get to know us <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-second\" id=\"hero-second\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>An idea is a start.</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>We bring it to life.</span></span></h2><p class=\"hero-second-copy\">We take the good part of “what if?” and turn it into something you can actually experience. From the first sketch to the final detail, we connect the ideas, people and production that bring it to life.</p><div class=\"hero-second-links\"><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#services\">See what we do <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-arrow-link\" href=\"#studio\">Get to know us <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-graphic\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Editorial transition -->\n<section class=\"manifesto section-gutter\" id=\"discover\">\n<div class=\"manifesto-grid\">\n<div class=\"manifesto-heading-group\"><h2 class=\"section-title plain-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Too good to leave</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">on the drawing board.</span></h2><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#studio\">Meet the people behind it <span>↗</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"manifesto-copy\"><p>You know that feeling when an idea clicks and suddenly you can see the whole thing? We live for that part. But we love what happens next even more. The planning. The pixels. The people. The power cables. The tiny decisions nobody notices until they are done right. We connect creative thinking with the practical craft it takes to bring a concept into the world. So the work does more than look impressive. It feels right, behaves right and makes people want to be part of it.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- THIRD ACT: full-frame scroll storyboard -->\n<section aria-label=\"From imagination to impact\" class=\"film-track\" id=\"film-track\">\n<div class=\"film-stage\" id=\"film-stage\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-images\">\n<div class=\"film-image is-on\" data-film-image=\"0\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/857bfe33201dcedbc6c9.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"film-image\" data-film-image=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/cacc0a760b075d1ccf18.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"film-image\" data-film-image=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"film-veil\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-gridline\"></div>\n<div class=\"film-story-inner\">\n<div class=\"film-steps\" id=\"film-steps\">\n<article class=\"film-step is-on\" data-film-step=\"0\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>First, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>imagine it.</span></span></h2><p>We get curious. Ask the awkwardly good questions. Pull things apart. Put unexpected things together. And find the idea worth chasing.</p></article>\n<article class=\"film-step\" data-film-step=\"1\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Then, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>make it happen.</span></span></h2><p>We design it, plan it, prototype it, build it and work through the bits nobody sees. This is where imagination meets the production schedule.</p></article>\n<article class=\"film-step\" data-film-step=\"2\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Finally, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>move people.</span></span></h2><p>The doors open. The launch goes live. The audience leans in. Everything clicks into place and the idea stops being an idea.</p></article>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-progress\"><span class=\"film-progress-fill\" id=\"film-progress-fill\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- FEATURED STORIES: three-column, horizontally advancing case studies -->\n<section class=\"portfolio-section section-gutter\" id=\"portfolio-section\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-heading\"><h2 class=\"section-title block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>The thinking</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>behind the thing.</span></span></h2><div class=\"portfolio-intro\"><p>A little more than a final image. We like to show what makes an idea work: the intention, the atmosphere, the choices and the craft. Here are a few creative explorations that take you behind the scenes of how we think.</p></div></div>\n<div aria-label=\"Featured creative explorations\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" class=\"case-carousel\" id=\"case-carousel\" role=\"region\">\n<div aria-label=\"Featured case studies: drag, swipe or use arrow keys\" aria-live=\"off\" class=\"case-viewport case-rail\" id=\"case-rail\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Atmosphere is everything\" class=\"case-slide is-active\" data-case-slide=\"0\" href=\"#case-events\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"Warm, beautifully lit outdoor event scene\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/evening.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>You can plan the programme. The feeling is what makes people stay.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Made to be remembered\" class=\"case-slide\" data-case-slide=\"1\" href=\"#case-identity\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"SHOWSET creative identity and designed brand materials\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cases/identity-hero.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Made to be remembered<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>Identity is built in a thousand little encounters, not one big reveal.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Behind every moment\" class=\"case-slide\" data-case-slide=\"2\" href=\"#case-production\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"Hands adjusting sound equipment during event production\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cases/production-hero.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Behind every moment<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>The quiet precision that makes a big production feel effortless.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- FOURTH ACT: a single visual focus, services are not cards -->\n\n<section aria-label=\"Explore our four service categories\" class=\"services-track\" id=\"services-track\">\n<div class=\"services-stage\">\n<div class=\"services-left\">\n<div class=\"services-stage-intro\" id=\"services\">\n<h2 class=\"services-panel-heading\"><span>Different disciplines<span class=\"service-heading-period\">.</span></span><span class=\"accent-text\">One connected team.</span></h2>\n<p>A launch might need an identity. An event might need a digital home. A campaign might need a film, a space or a piece of technology to make it work. We move between all four worlds so the idea stays in one piece.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-navigation\">\n<a class=\"discipline is-on\" data-service=\"0\" href=\"#events\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Events &amp; experiences</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"1\" href=\"#creative\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Creative &amp; design</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"2\" href=\"#digital\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Digital &amp; marketing</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"3\" href=\"#production\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Content &amp; production</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"services-right\" id=\"services-right\">\n<div class=\"service-visual is-on\" data-service-visual=\"0\"><img alt=\"Atmospheric outdoor event with warm lights\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual\" data-service-visual=\"1\"><img alt=\"Carefully designed SHOWSET brand materials\" src=\"/concept-12/7f12ec7b20911ecee355.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual service-digital\" data-service-visual=\"2\"><div class=\"digital-stage\"><div class=\"digital-screen\"><div class=\"digital-top\"><span>showset<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></span></div><div class=\"digital-type\">THE NEXT<br/><em>BIG THING<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></em></div><div class=\"digital-bottom\"><span>Ideas with purpose.</span></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual\" data-service-visual=\"3\"><img alt=\"Hands on a professional sound mixing desk\" src=\"/concept-12/aa01c56d7f9e7726002f.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-image-overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"service-image-information\"><p id=\"service-visual-copy\">We imagine, produce and deliver experiences that bring people together.</p><a aria-label=\"Explore Events &amp; experiences\" href=\"#events\" id=\"service-visual-link\">Step inside this world <span>↗</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ORIGINAL V2 TREATMENT: the single teal dot grows to fill the view -->\n<section aria-label=\"SHOWSET approach\" class=\"dot-track\" id=\"dot-track\">\n<div class=\"dot-stage\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dot-core\" id=\"dot-core\"></div>\n<div class=\"dot-words\"><h2>Serious about the <em>details.</em><br/>Wild about the <em>possibilities<span>.</span></em></h2><p>The small stuff is never small when you are making something big.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"end-section section-gutter\" id=\"ending\"><h2 class=\"section-title plain-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Got a beautifully</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">complicated idea?</span></h2><div class=\"end-bottom\"><p>The brief can be polished, half-written or still living entirely in your head. Tell us what you are trying to make happen. We know where to start.</p><a class=\"solid-link end-link\" href=\"#contact\">Let’s make a plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>\n</div>\n<!-- Dynamic service page, each category has its own route -->\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"service\">\n<section class=\"category-hero\" id=\"category-hero\"><div class=\"category-bg\"><img alt=\"\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"category-image\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div><div class=\"category-gradient\"></div><div class=\"category-inner\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\" id=\"category-title\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Events &amp;</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>experiences.</span></span></h1><p id=\"category-description\">The room. The crowd. The goosebumps. The perfectly timed reveal. We bring bold ideas and meticulous planning together to turn gatherings into experiences.</p><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#contact\">Plan something brilliant <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-detail section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"category-belief\">It's about how it feels.</h2><div class=\"category-detail-bottom\"><p id=\"category-belief-copy\"></p></div><div class=\"category-clusters\"><div class=\"category-clusters-title\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">How we bring it together.</h2><p>Different parts. One connected idea.</p></div><div class=\"cluster-grid\" id=\"category-clusters\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"category-feature\" id=\"category-feature\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"category-feature-title\"></h2><p id=\"category-feature-copy\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"category-process\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">From the first thought to the final detail.</h2><div class=\"process-grid\" id=\"category-process-list\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"category-capabilities\"><div class=\"category-capabilities-head\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Explore the possibilities.</h2><p>More ways we can help, depending on your brief.</p></div><div class=\"capabilities-list\" id=\"category-capabilities-list\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-banner\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"category-banner\" src=\"/concept-12/cacc0a760b075d1ccf18.webp\"/><div class=\"category-banner-shade\"></div><div><h2 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Let's make</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>it memorable<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></span></span></h2><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#contact\">Bring us your brief <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-more section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Keep exploring<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><div id=\"category-more-links\"></div></section>\n</div>\n<!-- Supporting pages -->\n<div class=\"view editorial-page studio-rebuilt\" data-view=\"studio\">\n<section class=\"studio-hero-track studio-hero editorial-hero\" aria-label=\"Introducing our studio\" data-studio-hero-track>\n<div class=\"studio-hero-stage\" data-studio-hero-stage>\n<div class=\"studio-hero-photo\" data-studio-hero-photo aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/media/planning.webp\" alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"/><div class=\"studio-hero-shade\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"studio-hero-scene studio-hero-scene-first\" data-studio-hero-first>\n<h1 class=\"block-heading studio-scroll-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Curious minds.</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>Capable hands<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h1>\n<p>We're creative thinkers, practical makers and the people who care how it all comes together.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"studio-hero-scene studio-hero-scene-follow\" data-studio-hero-follow>\n<h2 class=\"block-heading studio-scroll-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>We think it through.</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>We make it happen<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h2>\n<p>From the first conversation to the last detail, we connect the creative and practical work that brings an idea to life.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"studio-copy studio-manifesto section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-manifesto-layout\"><h2 class=\"studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Good ideas need</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">good company<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2><div class=\"studio-manifesto-body\"><p>We work across events, creative, digital and production, which means the big picture and the small details can sit at the same table.</p><p>Sometimes we're shaping an event from the first sketch. Sometimes we're building the brand, the website, the content or the technical side that brings it to life. We join the right minds and hands around the brief, without making you manage all the moving parts.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-exploration studio-exploration-storyboard section-gutter\" aria-label=\"From the first sketch to the final cue\">\n<div class=\"studio-exploration-intro\">\n<h2 class=\"studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">From the first sketch</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">to the final cue<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2>\n<p>Great work doesn't happen in separate departments. We keep the thinking, making and doing connected from the first conversation to the final detail.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"studio-storyboard\" data-studio-storyboard>\n<article class=\"studio-storyboard-chapter\">\n<figure class=\"studio-storyboard-shot\" data-studio-shot=\"0\"><img src=\"/media/planning.webp\" alt=\"Hands preparing a SHOWSET event concept and seating plan\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\n<div class=\"studio-storyboard-copy\"><h3>Find the idea.</h3><p>We listen, question and look for the thing that will make this brief matter. Strategy, concepts and creative direction start here.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"studio-storyboard-chapter\">\n<figure class=\"studio-storyboard-shot\" data-studio-shot=\"1\"><img src=\"/media/details.webp\" alt=\"Close-up of crafted brand and production details\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\n<div class=\"studio-storyboard-copy\"><h3>Make it tangible.</h3><p>Visual identities, layouts, websites and content. We turn a direction into something you can see, use and build on.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"studio-storyboard-chapter\">\n<figure class=\"studio-storyboard-shot\" data-studio-shot=\"2\"><img src=\"/media/rigging.webp\" alt=\"Behind-the-scenes technical event production\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\n<div class=\"studio-storyboard-copy\"><h3>Make it happen.</h3><p>On-site production, live experiences and the final details. Good thinking means little if it never gets made.</p></div></article>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-partnership studio-outlook section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-outlook-heading\"><h2 class=\"studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">One brief. A whole lot</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">of ways to make it happen<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2></div><div class=\"studio-partnership-body\"><p>From the screen to the stage, we connect the disciplines a project needs. You get the right mix of creative thinking, digital craft and real-world production, without the extra handovers.</p><nav class=\"studio-capability-links\" aria-label=\"Our disciplines\"><a href=\"/events-experiences/\">Events &amp; experiences <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/creative-design/\">Creative &amp; design <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/digital-marketing/\">Digital &amp; marketing <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a href=\"/content-production/\">Content &amp; production <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></nav></div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-final studio-final-pattern editorial-ending section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-final-inner\"><div><h2 class=\"studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Got a beautifully</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">complicated idea<span class=\"service-period\">?</span></span></h2><div class=\"studio-final-copy\"><p>The brief can be polished, half-written or still living entirely in your head. Tell us what you are trying to make happen. We know where to start.</p></div><a class=\"solid-link editorial-action\" href=\"/contact/\">Let's make a plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section>\n</div><div class=\"view editorial-page work-rebuilt\" data-view=\"work\">\n<section class=\"simple-hero work-hero editorial-hero\"><div class=\"simple-bg\"><img src=\"/media/rigging.webp\" alt=\"Event production and lighting behind the scenes\" data-depth-image=\"\"/></div><div class=\"simple-shade\"></div><div class=\"simple-hero-content\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Work with</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>something to say<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h1><p>Every brief has a story. This is where we share the thinking, craft and detail behind the projects and possibilities we're exploring.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"work-page-intro section-gutter\"><div class=\"work-editorial-note\"><h2 class=\"work-intro-title\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Different briefs.</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">Different thinking<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2><div class=\"work-intro-copy\"><p>A growing collection across events, design, digital and production. From what happens behind the scenes to what people see, feel and remember, every story has its own shape.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"work-page-gallery section-gutter\" aria-label=\"Selected work and creative studies\"><div class=\"work-index-tools\" data-work-filters hidden></div><div class=\"case-index\" data-work-index></div><div class=\"work-index-more\" data-work-more hidden><button type=\"button\" data-work-more-button>See more stories <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></section>\n<section class=\"work-final studio-final studio-final-pattern editorial-ending section-gutter\"><div class=\"work-final-inner studio-final-inner\"><div><h2 class=\"studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Got something</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">worth making<span class=\"service-period\">?</span></span></h2><div class=\"studio-final-copy\"><p class=\"work-final-copy\">The next story could start with a conversation. Bring us the idea, the challenge or the wonderfully ambitious brief.</p></div><a class=\"solid-link editorial-action\" href=\"/contact/\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section>\n</div><div class=\"view\" data-view=\"case-study\">\n<section class=\"case-detail-hero\"><div class=\"case-detail-photo\"><img alt=\"\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"case-detail-image\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-detail-wash\"></div><div class=\"case-detail-header section-gutter\"><h1 id=\"case-detail-title\">Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h1><p id=\"case-detail-intro\"></p></div></section>\n<section class=\"case-detail-body section-gutter\"><div class=\"case-detail-introduction\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"case-detail-belief\"></h2><p id=\"case-detail-description\"></p></div><blockquote class=\"case-quote\" id=\"case-detail-quote\"></blockquote><div class=\"case-detail-visual\"><img alt=\"Creative process imagery\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"case-detail-second-image\" src=\"/concept-12/f778ffc756368369e22f.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-detail-next\"><p>A good idea deserves a good ending. What could yours become?</p><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#contact\">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view contact-rebuilt\" data-view=\"contact\"><section class=\"contact-view section-gutter\" aria-label=\"Start a conversation with SHOWSET\">\n<div class=\"contact-shell\">\n<div class=\"contact-left\">\n<div class=\"contact-intro\"><h1 class=\"plain-heading contact-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Something</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">brewing<span class=\"service-period\">?</span></span></h1><p>Big idea, rough sketch or a brief that isn't quite there yet? We're listening.</p></div>\n<div class=\"contact-direct\"><a data-contact-email href=\"mailto:hello@showset.co.za\">hello@showset.co.za</a><a data-contact-phone href=\"tel:+27682805777\">+27 68 280 5777</a></div>\n<a class=\"contact-whatsapp\" data-contact-whatsapp href=\"https://wa.me/27682805777\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Message SHOWSET on WhatsApp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.4 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-12.3 7.4L3.8 20l1.1-4.3a8.4 8.4 0 1 1 15.5-4.2Z\"/><path d=\"M8.7 9.2c.5 2.6 2.4 4.5 5 5l1.4-1.2 1.1.6c-.2 1.5-1.1 2.3-2.5 2.2a8.6 8.6 0 0 1-6.4-6.5c-.1-1.4.7-2.3 2.2-2.5l.6 1.1-1.4 1.3Z\"/></svg><span>Message us on WhatsApp</span><span class=\"contact-whatsapp-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n</div>\n<form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contact-form\" aria-label=\"Tell us about your project\">\n<h2 class=\"sr-only\">Tell us the interesting bit.</h2>\n<div class=\"contact-name-email\">\n<div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"full-name\">Your name</label><input id=\"full-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"What should we call you?\" maxlength=\"120\" required/></div>\n<div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"email\">Email address</label><input id=\"email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"Where can we reach you?\" maxlength=\"254\" required/></div></div>\n<div class=\"contact-field contact-message\"><label for=\"message\">What's the idea?</label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"The idea, the challenge, the wonderfully complicated bits. Start anywhere.\" maxlength=\"5000\" required></textarea></div>\n<div class=\"contact-timing-budget\">\n<div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"project-date\">Event or launch date <span>(optional)</span></label><input id=\"project-date\" name=\"date\" placeholder=\"e.g. March 2027\" maxlength=\"120\"/></div>\n<div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"project-budget\">Rough budget <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"project-budget\" name=\"budget\"><option value=\"\">Not sure yet</option><option>Still working it out</option><option>Under R50 000</option><option>R50 000 – R150 000</option><option>R150 000 – R500 000</option><option>R500 000+</option><option>Prefer to discuss</option></select></div>\n</div>\n<details class=\"contact-extra\"><summary>A few more details? <span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></summary><div class=\"contact-extra-fields\">\n<div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"company\">Company or organisation <span>(optional)</span></label><input id=\"company\" name=\"company\" autocomplete=\"organization\" placeholder=\"If there is one\" maxlength=\"160\"/></div>\n<div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"project-type\">What are we making? <span>(optional)</span></label><div class=\"custom-select\" id=\"project-combobox\"><select class=\"native-select-fallback\" id=\"project-type\" name=\"type\"><option value=\"\">Choose the closest fit</option><option>An event or experience</option><option>A brand or design project</option><option>A website or digital solution</option><option>Marketing and content</option><option>Film or production</option><option>A bit of everything</option><option>Not quite sure yet</option></select><button aria-controls=\"project-options\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"What are we making?\" class=\"select-trigger\" id=\"project-trigger\" role=\"combobox\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"select-value\">Choose the closest fit</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\"><path d=\"m2.5 4.5 3.5 3.5 3.5-3.5\"/></svg></button><div aria-label=\"Project type\" class=\"select-panel\" id=\"project-options\" role=\"listbox\"><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"An event or experience\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">An event or experience</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A brand or design project\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A brand or design project</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A website or digital solution\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A website or digital solution</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Marketing and content\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Marketing and content</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Film or production\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Film or production</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A bit of everything\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A bit of everything</button><button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Not quite sure yet\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Not quite sure yet</button></div></div></div>\n</div></details>\n<div class=\"contact-honeypot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"contact-website\">Leave this field blank</label><input id=\"contact-website\" name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"/></div>\n<div class=\"contact-submit-row\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"solid-link contact-submit\">Prepare the email <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><p class=\"form-note\" id=\"contact-form-note\">Your message hasn't been sent. This opens a prepared email for you to review and send.</p></div><p class=\"form-result\" id=\"form-result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n</form></div></section></div>\n\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-head\"><div class=\"footer-identity\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\"><img class=\"approved-wordmark\" src=\"/brand/approved-wordmark.png\" alt=\"SHOWSET — events &amp; creative agency\" width=\"962\" height=\"250\"/></a><p>We think it through. We make it happen.<br/>We make it feel like something.</p></div><div class=\"footer-links\"><div><span>DISCOVER</span><a href=\"#home\">Home</a><a href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a href=\"#work\">Our work</a><a href=\"#cont